flowchart LR
  Visitor[Website visitor] --> CW[Chatwoot Inbox]
  CW -->|signed message event| Reception[Durable reception queue]
  Reception -->|untrusted inquiry only| AI[Restricted Codex / model adapter]
  AI -->|schema-validated suggestions| Bridge[Durable CRM outbox]
  Bridge -->|API key + bridge key| Core[Revenue Core]
  Core --> PG[(PostgreSQL)]
  Operator[Authenticated operator] --> UI[Sales workspace]
  UI -->|review fields| Lead[Lead]
  UI -->|create / move stage| Opp[Opportunity + history]
  UI -->|explicit human checks| Q[Qualified decision]
  Lead & Opp & Q --> Core
  Core -->|one transaction| Event[Stable conversion event + outbox]
  Event --> Mock[Mock receipt ledger]
  Event -. separately configured .-> Ads[Meta / Google adapters]
  CW -. original conversation link .-> UI
  Fixtures[3 fictional demo scenarios] --> Core
